![Photo by George Girnas on Unsplash](cover.jpg)

*ProcessWire command-line companion*

Version 1.0.6, compatibility: ProcessWire 3.x

A command-line interface for CMS/CMF
[ProcessWire](https://processwire.com) based on the Symfony Console
component. Can be easily extended through ProcessWire's ability of
being bootstrapped into other applications, its great
[API](https://processwire.com/api/) and Symfony Console's
[modular command approach](http://symfony.com/doc/current/components/console/introduction%20%20%20%20%20%20.html).

Wireshell's code and documentation were extended/cleaned up by
@clsource.

```github
wireshell/wireshell | Un compañero de línea de comandos para ProcessWire
```
